==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The {{vern|cane apple}}, an evergreen shrub or small tree (''[[Arbutus unedo]]''), in family [[Ericaceae]], native to the Mediterranean region and western Europe north to western France and Ireland, which bears fruits which resemble strawberries.
#: {{syn|en|arbutus|madrone}}
## Any of the other species of ''[[Arbutus]]'', native to Europe and temperate North America, especially
### The [[madrone]], ''[[Arbutus menziesii]]'', an evergreen tree with rich orange-red bark which naturally peels away in thin sheets when mature, and which bears berries which are astringent but edible if prepared properly.
###: {{syn|en|madrone|madrona|{{vern|Pacific madrone}}}}
# ''[[Muntingia calabura]]'' in the family [[Malvaceae]], native to the American tropics
# ''[[Myrica rubra]]'' in the family [[Myricaceae]], the [[Chinese strawberry tree]]

